'''Bioblade''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Bioblade Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since went offsale.

==Appearance==
It has a large dao-shaped blade that is primarily a gray shade. The edge of the blade is lime green in color with two indents leading into the gray guard with three green streaks on it. Attached to the blade is a test tube filled to the top with green biotic fluid. On the guard is a lime green circle, and the handle is gray in color with tape wrapped around it. Attached to the bottom of the handle is its glowing green pommel.

==Trivia==
*Like many of the other recent gamepasses, the pass came only with this knife without a [[Pets|pet]] or [[Effects|effect]].
*It was the first shop godly to be released in [[Season 1]].
*It is commonly partnered with [[Biogun]].
*This is [[Nikilis]]’ favorite weapon.
**It is also [[Zyleak|Zyleaks]] favorite weapon.
*It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]].
*Unlike most weapons, it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

